   "text": {
    "L1": "A neighbourhood has public places that serve everyone.",
    "L2": "The post office sends letters and parcels, and it can keep savings.",
    "L3": "A bank keeps money safe, gives loans, and pays interest to savers.",
    "L4": "A hospital treats sick people, while the police help keep people safe.",
    "L5": "A bank is not only a locked safe. It can also lend money to people who need a loan.",
    "L6": "Public places are for everyone, so we must use them carefully and keep them clean.",
    "L7": "A map uses symbols and directions to show where neighbourhood places are.",
    "L8": "Now check: which place can keep savings and give a loan?"
   },
